{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他不想被失去推着走，开始考虑往后怎么生活，也不愿只等别人安慰。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I13\", \"I15\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I12\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"过去回不来，他也不肯低头，仍坚持看重的事，不愿为被接纳而委屈自己。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I14\", \"I16\", \"I17\"],\n      \"cite\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"坚持让难受有了出口，他重新肯定自己，知道失去没夺走一切，也比先前更有力量。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I18\", \"I19\", \"I20\", \"I21\"],\n      \"cite\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他仍舍不得过去，但如今不只看见缺憾，还为守住珍贵的东西骄傲，仿佛能靠自己向前。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I22\", \"I23\", \"I24\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I10\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7dd2af8e-430b-467d-926d-19f930b17f20", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261101T044819797115Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-01T04:49:06.600931+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8c4cc669a37ed24a69e0d708712789491019b3632ca8b1eb5ae1826519a46f26", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251